  all-traces
  "∀ B bid rst #i #j.
    ((UseBatchEndToken( B, bid, rst ) @ #i) ∧
     (UseBatchEndToken( B, bid, rst ) @ #j)) ⇒
    (#i = #j)"
/*
guarded formula characterizing all counter-examples:
"∃ B bid rst #i #j.
  (UseBatchEndToken( B, bid, rst ) @ #i) ∧
  (UseBatchEndToken( B, bid, rst ) @ #j)
 ∧
  ¬(#i = #j)"
*/
