guarded formula characterizing all counter-examples:
"∃ B bid rst idx1 A1 idx2 A2 m #d.
  (DuplicateDetected( B, bid, rst, idx1, A1, idx2, A2, m ) @ #d)
 ∧
  ∃ A idx m2 sid k #r.
